      "title": "Retrieve a purchase credit note",
      "summary": "Returns one purchase credit note under `purchase_credit_note`.",
      "description": "Returns the purchase credit note with its supplier, the payment that raised it, its rows and the initial, remaining and refunded amounts, under `purchase_credit_note`.",
      "parameters": [
